# act secrets — copy to .act.secrets (make act-init). NEVER commit the real file.
#
# THIS FILE SHOULD NORMALLY STAY EMPTY.
#
# All secrets come from Infisical. `make ci` runs act under `infisical run`, which
# exports them as environment variables — and that is exactly how act resolves the
# bare `-s NAME` declarations in ~/.actrc. Nothing secret belongs on disk here.
#
# Use this file only for a throwaway value you are deliberately keeping out of
# Infisical while debugging, and delete it afterwards.
